      "message": "If we inject flags like this via soong, isn\u0027t that more of a `Global` flag than a `Local` flag?\n\nI would have expected *only* what was specified in a project\u0027s Android.bp to be a `Local` flag, nothing more, nothing less.  Local flags should be immutable and filtering should occur when composing the final list of flags.  Or am I misunderstanding the distinction between `Global` and `Local`?",
